    "updated_at": "2025-03-24T02:33:11Z",
    "body": "> It's also there because it felt odd for the `ImageDataSettings` to have a pixelFormat for use by constructors that would then disappear and not be query-able.\r\n\r\nRight, I think it's a reasonable member of `ImageData` if it needs to be passed in via settings—it was just the passing in via settings that I was questioning in the first place. I think your explanation of different pixel format types mapping to the same underlying `ArrayBuffer` type makes sense and is compelling, thanks!",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
